  "title": "60% of Consumers Want Easier Access to Self-Service Solutions",
  "summary": "As consumer expectations continue to evolve, 60% of consumers say they want easier access to self-service solutions that allow them to resolve issues quickly and independently. This growing preference reflects demand for speed, convenience, and intuitive digital experiences across industries. Businesses that invest in seamless self-service tools can better meet customer needs while improving efficiency and satisfaction.",
